{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "skill2": "【附加包】向敌人脚下扔出惊吓魔盒（可被打掉），弹开时<#ef5350ff>恐惧<>周围敌方英雄<#ffb900ff>1秒<>（小兵和野怪<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>），随后<#ffb900ff>5秒<>内每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>对周围所有敌人造成<#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% 法强<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。",
        "attack": "【附加包】匕首刺击。被动 <#ff9028ff>背刺<>：从背后攻击敌方英雄时额外造成<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>双面毒刃<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>下一次普攻改为掷出毒刃，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法强<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>减速30%<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】短暂消失，在身旁召出幻像，持续<#ffb900ff>5秒<>：幻像自己追击、攻击敌人，每下造成<#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，受到的伤害提高<#ffb900ff>50%<>，可以被击杀。它阵亡或到时间时爆炸，造成<#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 法强<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，并放出三个小魔盒<#ef5350ff>恐惧<>周围敌人。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "skill2": "【附加包】向敵人腳下扔出驚嚇魔盒（可被打掉），彈開時<#ef5350ff>恐懼<>周圍敵方英雄<#ffb900ff>1秒<>（小兵和野怪<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>），隨後<#ffb900ff>5秒<>內每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>對周圍所有敵人造成<#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% 法術強度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。",
        "attack": "【附加包】匕首刺擊。被動 <#ff9028ff>背刺<>：從背後攻擊敵方英雄時額外造成<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。<#ff9028ff>雙面毒刃<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>下一次普攻改為擲出毒刃，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法術強度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>緩速30%<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】短暫消失，在身旁召出幻象，持續<#ffb900ff>5秒<>：幻象自己追擊、攻擊敵人，每下造成<#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>，受到的傷害提高<#ffb900ff>50%<>，可以被擊殺。它陣亡或到時間時爆炸，造成<#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 法術強度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，並放出三個小魔盒<#ef5350ff>恐懼<>周圍敵人。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Shaco throws a Jack-in-the-Box (it can be destroyed) at an enemy's feet. It springs open, <#ef5350ff>fearing<> enemy champions around it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (minions and monsters <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>), then fires at every enemy nearby every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> per shot.",
        "attack": "[Add-on] Dagger stabs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Backstab<>: attacks on enemy champions from behind deal <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Two-Shiv Poison<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> his next attack throws a shiv instead, dealing <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 30%.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Shaco briefly vanishes and a clone appears beside him for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: it chases and attacks enemies on its own for <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> a hit, takes <#ffb900ff>50%<> more damage and can be killed. When it dies or its time is up it explodes for <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, releasing three mini boxes that <#ef5350ff>fear<> nearby enemies."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "skill2": "[확장] 적의 발밑에 깜짝 상자(파괴 가능)를 던집니다. 상자가 열리며 주변 적 챔피언을 <#ffb900ff>1초<>(미니언과 몬스터 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<>) 동안 <#ef5350ff>공포<>에 빠뜨리고, <#ffb900ff>5초<> 동안 <#ffb900ff>0.5초<>마다 주변 모든 적에게 <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 12%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입힙니다.",
        "attack": "[확장] 단검으로 찌릅니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>암습<>: 적 챔피언을 뒤에서 공격하면 <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 25%<> 추가 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>. <#ff9028ff>양날 독<>: <#ffb900ff>8초<>마다 다음 기본 공격 대신 독 단검을 던져 <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입히고 <#ef5350ff>30% 둔화<>시킵니다.",
        "ult": "[확장] 잠시 사라졌다가 자신의 곁에 <#ffb900ff>5초<> 동안 분신을 불러냅니다. 분신은 스스로 적을 쫓아 공격해 한 번에 <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 40%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 입히고, 받는 피해가 <#ffb900ff>50%<> 늘며 처치될 수 있습니다. 분신이 죽거나 끝나면 폭발해 <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 100%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입히고 작은 상자 세 개가 주변 적을 <#ef5350ff>공포<>에 빠뜨립니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵の足元にびっくり箱（倒せる）を投げる。開くと周囲の敵チャンピオンを<#ffb900ff>1秒<>（ミニオンとモンスターは<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>）<#ef5350ff>フィアー<>状態にし、<#ffb900ff>5秒<>間<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>ごとに周囲の全ての敵に<#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の12%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。",
        "attack": "【拡張】短剣で刺す。パッシブ <#ff9028ff>バックスタブ<>：敵チャンピオンの背後からの攻撃は<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の25%<>の追加<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。<#ff9028ff>ポイズンダガー<>：<#ffb900ff>8秒<>ごとに次の通常攻撃で短剣を投げ、<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>30%スロウ<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】一瞬姿を消し、自分のそばに分身を<#ffb900ff>5秒<>間呼び出す。分身は自ら敵を追い攻撃し、1回ごとに<#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の40%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。被ダメージが<#ffb900ff>50%<>増え、倒されることもある。倒されるか時間切れで爆発し<#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の100%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、小さな箱3つが周囲の敵を<#ef5350ff>フィアー<>状態にする。"
      }
    }
  }
}
